  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-visits-the-dentist-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "47d84e34f9f6dd36dedf1634979484eadd46f2e2bc624a80ca347383917b71ac",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7dc0ab3d0655989456301f71711ec9976eb18bb17e61ed529c3a92070fc0b0f7",
      "text": "悟空看牙医",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ffc336d04427842bf12b6d35a540501acd1f30ad0dbe495041549994c1d508e9",
      "text": "今天，悟空\n要去看牙医。\n沙僧陪他一起去。\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "40db2f74b13fe79faefd306bd4afa4197af848ff6357ef152bce5884377a8472",
      "text": "八戒也在候诊室。\n“嗨，悟空！”\n悟空看见一张大椅子。\n“哇！”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aa14b276ab1e671382b4b86bb640dd40c0482c8758754f8e603391b74a2784ef",
      "text": "嗡嗡，嗡嗡！\n“是大蜜蜂吗？”\n悟空拉紧沙僧的手。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "84da2d16d8ad7586c6b7aa8c00ae3a362b2fda33cfe692213bf1b6b449cc170f",
      "text": "牙医阿姨笑了。\n她的衣服上有好多小熊。\n“你好，悟空！\n我们先看一看。”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9cf08df3ea384662d37f8525680115d7637633b800d0fa1f5988a29290041553",
      "text": "她拿出一面小镜子：\n“它能帮我看清\n你的牙齿。”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3bcf924cc50c7e5c304fdae578dfe4896a7aa98c07fdfe88279377ab8f346a10",
      "text": "“如果你想停一下，\n就举起手，\n我就会停下来。”\n悟空点点头。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f86981a94fffa868749d6755a0f6e15278b7675f6d2ad2d88b8f4994c7a5b8eb",
      "text": "悟空爬上大椅子。\n牙医阿姨问：“准备好了吗？”\n椅子慢慢升高了！\n“像坐在小云朵上！”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "665fef5d6df154c19c131a8a482e9a57394a54d128ea5c9c2a3036bf9d246cb5",
      "text": "牙医阿姨说：“张大嘴巴。”\n“啊——”\n她一颗一颗地看。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e4998dbbd463a9369715950d2bb1b4598199b1f486d033e7dfcf680d4505f97f",
      "text": "嗡——\n悟空有点害怕，\n他举起了手。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0746c083df3b03cc000893d4ae98dd2c99bca2851e681faf1b01abbb71a6cbd5",
      "text": "牙医阿姨马上停下来：\n“好的，我们停一停。”\n沙僧握住他的手。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b1e64562eba5a2e8717b9565e1c493cfadef67a973d0709f2598c0ec9b238c9f",
      "text": "悟空问：\n“是什么在嗡嗡响？”\n牙医阿姨说：“是我的小刷子，\n有点痒痒的。”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3f72de61126aacab4516c1fcb479aa920cfa4f07dfd5d837804ba2e5ebaf3c73",
      "text": "悟空说：\n“我准备好了。”\n他又张大了嘴巴。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "df1c62c4c22fd2edd2af0bf8de081712bea138fbeeb6afa817a4eb9add962ac9",
      "text": "嗡嗡，嗡嗡，\n痒痒的！\n牙医阿姨说：“检查完啦！”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "940636fae0c8a0b3c6711d6d2a37e07cbdb9026ab2b1e1dcddbf2852f4736def",
      "text": "悟空照着小镜子笑：\n“我会告诉你我需要什么！”\n临走时，牙医阿姨\n送给他一把小牙刷。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "48fd7697318eb9219eaa4836d07adab796aed581cd860b3d9bc53069c6a26db4",
      "text": "回到家，八戒的玩偶排好队。\n悟空说：“张大嘴巴！\n如果想停一下，\n就举起小爪子！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
